%% UK Regulatory Burden — Diagram 2: Per-candidate decision tree (logic view / gap-finder)
%% The full logical path ONE candidate section walks: raw assembled text →
%%   N burdens (each with category/polarity/obligated_party/actor_capacity/provenance)
%%   OR excluded-with-typed-reason OR routed-to-review.
%% Every decision node is annotated (MANDATORY):  rule (source) · exec (executor) · status.
%%   exec = L1/L2 rule · L3 model · L4 lookup · L5 human · or UNALLOCATED.
%%   status = BUILT (DECIDED-BUILT) / DESIGN (DECIDED-UNBUILT) / OPEN.
%% Sources: rubric v2.2 (§1-§7), rubric_revision_notes.md (items 4-9), implementation_plan.md.
%% Companion: pipeline_architecture.mmd (systems view); decision_tree_gaps.md (deliverable).
%% NB: nearly the whole tree is OPEN/DESIGN — Stage-2 is ratified design, not built. Only L1 intake is BUILT.

flowchart TD

  IN["INTAKE: assembled section block + leaves[] + hints (per candidate)<br/>rule: §Extraction unit — one record per flagged section<br/>anchor THREE-TIER (2026-07-16): T1 P-level · T2 numbered Division/Para · T3 schedule/annex prose+list &amp; body tail-clause<br/>8 material_types (added uk_schedule_unnumbered / eu_annex / uk_body_tail; four legacy counters untouched)<br/>exec: L1 · status: BUILT"]:::built
  RECALL["UPSTREAM GATE: a section with NO cue anywhere is never surfaced<br/>rule: Stage-1 recall gate (word_list union = the ceiling)<br/>exec: L1 · status: OPEN (silent FN risk; only control is recall audit vs ground truth)"]:::open
  ORPH["ORPHAN TRIAGE LANE: orphan / context_quality=partial candidates (n_leaves=0)<br/>POST tier-3 (G29): old-drafting schedule/annex orphans now anchored — lane handles RESIDUE only<br/>rule: RATIFIED — LLM first-pass CLEARS clearly-non-operative (records typed §4 exclusion, → gaps G2);<br/>verdict ASYMMETRIC (clear only the clearly-non-operative, escalate the rest); triage does NOT label burdens<br/>escalated → enriched with retrievable surrounding raw text → RE-ENTER standard path (N5..N10),<br/>normal dual-model + review; orphan=true carried to the final record (same shape; auditable slice)<br/>exec: UNBUILT (lane) · status: DECIDED-UNBUILT (rule ratified, lane unbuilt) · → gaps G25"]:::design
  IN -.->|precondition| RECALL
  IN -.->|orphan / partial subset| ORPH
  ORPH -->|cleared: non-operative| X_NOP
  ORPH -->|escalated, context-enriched| N5

  IN --> N1

  N1["N1  OPERATIVE? binds an obligation/prohibition (not deem/define/enable)<br/>rule: §4 non-operative exclusion list — SETTLED (survived three reviews untouched)<br/>exec: UNALLOCATED (L2 deterministic vs L3 LLM split — allocation question, → gaps G1)<br/>status: DECIDED-UNBUILT (rule decided, executor unbuilt)"]:::design
  N1 -->|non-operative| X_NOP["EXCLUDED · exclusion_family=non_operative<br/>subclass ∈ {deeming, definitional, machinery_procedural, powers_to_make_secondary,<br/>scheme_machinery, list_of_contents, mixed_other} (recorded best-effort)<br/>exec: UNBUILT (exclusion writer) · status: DECIDED-UNBUILT (typed-exclusion schema ratified, → gaps G2)"]:::design
  N1 -->|operative| N2

  N2["N2  Operative content is a TEXTUAL AMENDMENT of another instrument?<br/>rule: notes item 4 (amendment = machinery; count at consolidated target) — RATIFIED<br/>exec: UNBUILT (markup-L4? LLM-L3?); is_amendment_insertion BROKEN (0/1,084 — see decision log)<br/>detect at Addition-fragment grain; fix or rename before Stage 2<br/>status: DECIDED-UNBUILT (rule decided, executor unbuilt)"]:::design
  N2 -->|yes| X_AMD["EXCLUDED · exclusion_family=counted_at_source, subclass=amendment_machinery — burden counted at target (residence)<br/>exec: UNBUILT (exclusion writer) · status: DECIDED-UNBUILT (typed-exclusion schema ratified, → gaps G2; taxonomy v2 2026-07-18)<br/>residual OPEN: dedup vs target + editorial-backlog zero-count tail (→ gaps G4/G18)"]:::design
  N2 -->|no| N3

  N3["N3  POINTER / HOOK / CROSS-REFERENCE only? (burden defined elsewhere)<br/>rule: §3 count-at-source family — SETTLED (cross-refs, compliance/contravention hooks, enabling powers,<br/>penalty-as-consequence, offence primary-vs-secondary; several ratified this month)<br/>exec: UNALLOCATED (L2 pattern vs L3 model + referenced-provision resolution — allocation question, → gaps G5)<br/>status: DECIDED-UNBUILT (rule decided, executor unbuilt)"]:::design
  N3 -->|reference only| X_PTR["EXCLUDED · exclusion_family=counted_at_source<br/>subclass ∈ {cross_reference, compliance_hook, enabling_power, penalty_as_consequence,<br/>secondary_offence_reference, mixed_other} (recorded best-effort)<br/>exec: UNBUILT · status: DECIDED-UNBUILT (schema ratified → gaps G2; cross-ref resolver → gaps G5)"]:::design
  N3 -->|carries its own burden| N4

  N4["N4  Burden falls on a PRIVATE ACTOR?<br/>rule: §1/§5C statutory-source function test (statutory=public / contractual=private; funding-irrelevant)<br/>exec: UNALLOCATED — needs a statutory-bodies REGISTRY (does not exist); keyword lists exist but UNWIRED<br/>status: OPEN"]:::open
  N4 -->|public body / no one| X_PUB["EXCLUDED · exclusion_family=public_body_or_no_one<br/>(levy duties on private firms still COUNT)<br/>exec: UNBUILT (exclusion writer) · status: DECIDED-UNBUILT (typed-exclusion schema ratified, → gaps G2)"]:::design
  N4 -->|genuinely mixed / hybrid| REVIEW
  N4 -->|private actor| N5

  N5["N5  DECOMPOSE into burden UNITS<br/>rule: §1 unit rule — obligation-leaf = count each; condition/factor-leaf = count once; span-merge across candidates<br/>exec: UNALLOCATED — THE Layer-3 architecture question (per-candidate / counting-head / BIO-tag / decompose-then-classify)<br/>status: OPEN (burden-vs-condition discriminator not empirically tested — §7 item 3)"]:::open
  N5 -->|leaf genuinely un-callable| REVIEW
  N5 -->|N burden units| PB

  PB["FOR EACH burden unit → N6..N10"]:::design

  PB --> N6
  N6["N6  CATEGORY 1-6<br/>rule: §2 six categories; Cat2-vs-Cat5 trigger-control; DEFENCE-DOMINANCE → IB/IBA (notes item 7); Cat6→review<br/>exec: L3 dual-model (Claude+Gemini) → L5 human on disagreement — TRAINING-DATA phase;<br/>production = Legal-BERT + confidence-thresholded review (low_confidence routes where disagreement did)<br/>status: DESIGN (defence-dominance = new simplification, pilot-contingent)"]:::design
  N6 -->|Cat 6 ambiguous| REVIEW
  N6 -->|category assigned| N7

  N7["N7  POLARITY — obligation / prohibition / review<br/>rule: §2A operative-requirement rule + edge cases; defence-revealed polarity = underlying standard (notes item 9)<br/>exec: L3 dual-model cross-checked → L5 human<br/>status: DESIGN (review-threshold discipline §7 item 9 not operationalised)"]:::design
  N7 -->|review| REVIEW
  N7 -->|polarity assigned| N8

  N8["N8  OBLIGATED PARTY — actual burdened party, not grammatical subject<br/>rule: §5B re-attribution; schema field obligated_party<br/>exec: L3/L4<br/>status: DESIGN (no controlled party vocabulary → capacity + dedup unstable)"]:::design
  N8 --> N9

  N9["N9  ACTOR CAPACITY — economic / personal / both-either / ambiguous<br/>rule: §1 + notes item 8 — classify the ACTIVITY not the subject; scheme-splits→follow-scheme;<br/>both/either needs POSITIVE 'binds identically either way'; else ambiguous (generous default)<br/>exec: UNALLOCATED — phase-1 generous default; boundary resolution deferred to phase 2/3<br/>status: OPEN (deferred; activity-profile rule new/untested; both/either reporting-line needs schema)"]:::open
  N9 --> N10

  N10["N10  PROVENANCE — introduced_by / introduced_year (nullable)<br/>rule: notes item 5 — residence (count) vs provenance (growth) split<br/>exec: UNALLOCATED — L4 Citation resolver (Addition→Commentary→Citation, ~100% recoverable) NOT built<br/>status: OPEN (fragment-grain, not is_amendment_insertion; multi-instrument sections)"]:::open
  N10 --> EMIT

  EMIT["EMIT BURDEN {category, polarity, obligated_party, actor_capacity, provenance, orphan?, family_id?}<br/>exec: L5 label store · status: OPEN (label store / version-control not built)"]:::open
  EMIT --> SPINE

  REVIEW["ROUTE TO REVIEW (Layer 5) — SCHEMA, not queue tooling<br/>review_reason (primary = first route to fire in tree order; optional secondary for compound cases):<br/>model_disagreement / hybrid_actor / ambiguous_leaf / cat6_category / polarity_review / orphan_escalation / context_term<br/>(+ low_confidence, family_link — PRODUCTION phase only); feeds@resolution ∈ {registry, rubric_example, unit_rule_evidence, training_data, definitions}<br/>lanes = sort records by review_reason; gating lanes first (disagreement blocks training_data, hybrid blocks registry, ambiguous_leaf feeds unit-rule test), rest pool<br/>PHASE: dual-model disagreement = training-data-phase signal; production = Legal-BERT confidence-threshold (same schema, different traffic mix)<br/>exec: L5 label store · status: DECIDED-UNBUILT (schema ratified; fields unbuilt pending label store) · → gaps G21<br/>NB set-vs-set burden-matching mechanics stay OPEN — the Layer-3 architecture question (→ gaps G20, allocation agenda)"]:::design

  SPINE["COUNTING SPINE: burden-count per candidate + grouping across candidates<br/>PRIMARY count = RESIDENCE-BASED: parallel duties in N jurisdictional instruments = N burdens (NO similarity test on the spine) — → gaps G18<br/>duplicate-family relation = SEPARATE enrichment lens (nullable family_id; uniform/divergent flag), post-labelling / pre-publication<br/>+ body↔schedule join (none, → gaps G19)<br/>→ headline total + economic FLOOR (economic-only; both/either own line)<br/>status: OPEN (spine impl + join unbuilt; devolution-dedup lens DECIDED-UNBUILT → G18)"]:::open

  classDef built fill:#1b5e20,stroke:#0d3311,color:#ffffff;
  classDef design fill:#8a6d00,stroke:#5a4700,color:#ffffff;
  classDef open fill:#8e1c1c,stroke:#5c0f0f,color:#ffffff;

  legB["BUILT"]:::built
  legD["DESIGN (DECIDED-UNBUILT)"]:::design
  legO["OPEN (gap)"]:::open
  legB ~~~ legD ~~~ legO
